# GRUB SHIFT: GATHER can be centred on any tile with a pod somewhere in its
# 3x3, even an empty one, and scoops up all of them.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat energy 0
cheat pods 2 1 1
cheat pods 4 3 2
cheat pods 3 3 1
cheat chip 6 27
cheat use 6 3 2
expect energy == 4
expect spent6 == 1
cheat chip 5 27
cheat use 5 0 4
expect spent5 == 0
